== quus_N for N = 2^j WITH auxiliary symbols (h, d, l, c) ==
quus_2 with auxiliary symbols                size    81  identities   10  true on range: True  derives the box: True
      h(x,0) = x
      h(x,Sy) = S(h(x,y))
      d(0) = 0
      d(Sx) = SS(d(x))
      l(x,0) = 0
      l(0,Sy) = S0
      l(Sx,Sy) = l(x,y)
      c(0,y,z) = z
      c(Sx,y,z) = y
      f(x,y) = c(l(x,d(S0)),c(l(y,d(S0)),h(x,y),S^50),S^50)
quus_4 with auxiliary symbols                size    83  identities   10  true on range: True  derives the box: True
